<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<worksheet xml:id="section-1-7">
  <title>Worksheet 1.7, Linear Independence</title>

  <page>

    <exercise xml:id="section-1-7-ex-1" workspace="2in"><introduction>
      <p> <em>Written Explanation Exercise</em></p>
      
    </introduction><task><statement><p>How are span and linear dependence related to each other?</p></statement></task></exercise>

    <exercise xml:id="section-1-7-ex-2" workspace="2in"><introduction>
      <p> In the exercises below, <m>\vec v_1,\vec v_2,\vec v_3</m> are three linearly independent vectors in <m>\mathbb{R}^3</m>. Which of the collections of vectors below are linearly independent?</p>
      
    </introduction><task><statement><p><m>\{\vec v_1,\ \vec v_2,\ \vec 0\}</m></p></statement></task><task><statement><p><m>\{\vec v_1,\ \vec v_1 + \vec v_2,\ \vec v_2\}</m></p></statement></task><task><statement><p><m>\{\vec v_1,\ \vec v_1 + \vec v_2\}</m></p></statement></task></exercise>

    <exercise xml:id="section-1-7-ex-3" workspace="2in"><statement>
      <p> For what values of <m>h</m> are the columns of <m>A</m> linearly dependent?</p>
      <p>
        <md>
        A =
        \begin{pmatrix}
          2 &amp; 4 &amp; -2 \\
          -2 &amp; -6 &amp; 2 \\
          4 &amp; 7 &amp; h
        \end{pmatrix}
        </md>
      </p>
    </statement></exercise>

</page>

<page>

    <exercise xml:id="section-1-7-ex-4" workspace="1in"><statement>
      <p> A <m>5 \times 3</m> matrix <m>A = \begin{pmatrix}\vec a_1 &amp; \vec a_2 &amp; \vec a_3\end{pmatrix}</m> has all non‑zero columns, and <m>\vec a_3 = 5\vec a_1 + 7\vec a_2</m>. Identify a non‑trivial solution to <m>A\vec x = \vec 0</m>.</p>
    </statement></exercise>

    <exercise xml:id="section-1-7-ex-5" workspace="2in"><introduction>
      <p> Short answer questions.</p>
      
    </introduction><task><statement><p>The columns of a <m>7 \times 5</m> matrix are linearly independent. How many pivots does the matrix have?</p></statement></task><task><statement><p>If the columns of a <m>3 \times 7</m> matrix span <m>\mathbb{R}^3</m>, how many pivots does the matrix have?</p></statement></task></exercise>

  </page>
</worksheet>